            "This result was used for the following analysis taking into account the assessment approach proposed in [12]: a) Silhouette coefficient SI value 0.501, b) the prediction strength coefficient did not exceed the cut-off value of 0.8, maintaining a value of 0.516 (however it\u2019s the highest value, except for k = 2 when considering the PAM algorithm), c) the Jaccard score presented a value of 0.794 for the combination of the PAM algorithm with the Morisita-Horn distance, exceeding the cut-off value of 0.75 (S8 Fig).",
